graph LR
    subgraph laptop [Your laptop]
        designer["Visual Designer / AI Design<br/>edits project.edsui"]
        code["Code section<br/>the .edsui of a widget or the screen"]
        studio["EmbeddedDisplay Studio<br/>validate, preview, deploy"]
        preview["hmi-ui.exe, headless<br/>the panel's own renderer<br/>draws the canvas, the bezel, the Code preview"]
        cli["deploy_to_hmi.sh<br/>the same thing, in CI"]
    end
    subgraph panel [The panel: no Qt, no compositor]
        ui["hmi-ui.service<br/>C11 + LVGL on DRM/KMS<br/>tag engine, bindings, alarms, touch"]
        current["/opt/hmi_apps/current<br/>project.edsui + assets"]
        kit["/usr/lib/hmi/kit<br/>Inter fonts, Tabler icon PNGs"]
        display["Connected display<br/>DRM reports its real geometry"]
        hwd["hmi-hwd.service<br/>libgpiod, IIO, UART, Modbus"]
    end
    designer --> studio
    designer --> code
    studio -->|renders through| preview
    studio -->|ssh: upload + hmi-install| ui
    cli -->|ssh: upload + hmi-install| ui
    ui -->|interprets| current
    ui --> kit
    ui -->|draws to| display
    hwd -->|tags, UDP/JSON on loopback| ui
    ui -->|commands| hwd
    display -.->|probed on connect; the bezel and the canvas follow it| studio
